{
  "name": "prr_merge",
  "description": "Merge one pull request. mode due: every condition checked again at merge time, then GitHub's auto-merge, the merge queue or a squash, as the Lemma's bot (never as a person). mode person: the person's own one-press merge on their own GitHub (github-personal), once no rule is broken. Logged in prr_merge_log.",
